" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/c2565f8fa8a752c24e96856b1b7d1ffe.poster.avif?t=1751549792\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/c2565f8fa8a752c24e96856b1b7d1ffe.webm?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/c2565f8fa8a752c24e96856b1b7d1ffe.mp4?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEAT-GRINDER is a visual novel in which we have to live the life of Obi - a female killer, who looks 18, due to genetic abnormalities.  Meet a bunch of memorable and interesting characters on her way!</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/161ed3db048d810a3d5fe7c0642fc95d.avif?t=1751549792\" width=616 height=614 /></span><br><br><strong>Kate</strong> - A smart girl, who unfortunately lost her arm as a result of shelling.<br><strong>Victor</strong> - A policeman who lives next door to the girls. What a pain in the ass.<br><strong>Betty</strong> - (She always hide in a box so that you won\u2019t see her mutilated body.)<br><strong>Adolf</strong> - An unfriendly artificial intelligence, liaison between the customer and the killer.<br><strong>Victoria</strong> - Victor's jealous and slightly crazy sister.<br><strong>Benya</strong> -A cat. Just a cat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/bbe26dc4517da343a225b2348bc17f1e.poster.avif?t=1751549792\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/bbe26dc4517da343a225b2348bc17f1e.webm?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/bbe26dc4517da343a225b2348bc17f1e.mp4?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>You will witness a real human meat grinder performed by Obi in various places around the planet on her killer missions!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><strong>  - Unique art style!</strong><br><strong>  - Original soundtrack!</strong><br><strong>  - Tons of black humor!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/cd98d587721e3af18aa8f98884801838.poster.avif?t=1751549792\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/cd98d587721e3af18aa8f98884801838.webm?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/cd98d587721e3af18aa8f98884801838.mp4?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/868b772bd846a28e7c1f35d131a57f87.poster.avif?t=1751549792\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/868b772bd846a28e7c1f35d131a57f87.webm?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591230/extras/868b772bd846a28e7c1f35d131a57f87.mp4?t=1751549792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
